#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://woocommerce.com/products/pdf-invoices/"
msgstr "https://woocommerce.com/products/pdf-invoices/"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Attach a PDF Invoice to the completed order email and allow invoices to be "
"downloaded from customer's My Account page."
